  "notes": [
   "The Certificate section refers to the Required Courses and Major Electives lists printed under the Associate in Arts degree; those lists were used for the blocks.",
   "Certificate text says 15 units of Required Courses and 9 units of Major Electives (also in the summary table: C 15 9 24). The list headings say 'CERTIFICATE: May select up to 9 units from the courses below or additional required courses from list above' for both lists, which conflicts with the 15-unit required figure; the Required Courses heading likely misprints the certificate figure. Electives 'up to 9 units' can apparently be replaced by additional required courses. Reviewer should check.",
   "Notes allow a maximum of 3 units of COOP ED toward the 24-unit certificate, and additional Labor Studies courses may be used to fulfill Major Units (contact the Labor Center).",
